[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3888092695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-3888092695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":3888092695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nv5YX","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-12T01:03:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T00:06:45Z","body":"> This makes sense to me. In the mac world, `aiff` is very widespread, especially because it supports metadata (as opposed to `wave`)\r\n\r\nNote that this is a basic implementation, which doesn't parse anything but strictly required chunks (pretty much what WAV support looked in early 3.0). Those could come later as the objective here is to make sure basic support is present.\r\n\r\n(and technically, WAV does support metadata through `LIST INFO` tags, already supported in Godot)\r\n\r\n>I've only superficially checked the code so far. Will need to do another pass, and we need someone to test a few aiff files (ideally exported by different sources such that they are as different as possible).\r\n\r\nOn my own tests, importing AIFF files with Signed 8/16/24/32-bit PCM exported by Audacity work just fine. The issue comes when you use any option other than those four (like **Un**signed 8-bit PCM), which turns the AIFF file into an AIFC internally.\r\n\r\nAnyway, if that's the case, parsing will fail very early and the user will be informed it's not supported. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3888092695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905508088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-3905508088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":3905508088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oyVL4","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T23:45:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T00:07:00Z","body":"> Those could come later as the objective here is to make sure basic support is present.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I believe that would be better done after #115534 to be more organized.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905508088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3914937922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-3914937922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":3914937922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pWTZC","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T14:15:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T16:04:46Z","body":"Seems like we can just `set_big_endian` on the file buffer instead of `BSWAP` everywhere.\r\n\r\nIt leads to cleaner code and a significantly smaller diff as it won't be moving parts around, so I'll go with it.\r\n\r\n**Edit: it also has no binary size penalty.**","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3914937922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3945444738","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-3945444738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":3945444738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rKrWC","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T15:28:07Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T15:42:00Z","body":"Tested with the [30 most downloaded AIFF sounds from freesound.org (first two pages)](https://freesound.org/search/?q=&f=license%253A%2522Creative%2520Commons%25200%2522%2520type%253A%2522aiff%2522&s=Downloads+%28most+first%29&si_tags=0&si_name=0&si_description=0&si_packname=0&si_sound_id=0&si_username=0&d0=0&d1=%2A&ig=0&r=0&g=1&dp=0&cm=0&mm=0&page=1#sound).\r\n\r\n[This one](https://freesound.org/people/hookhead/sounds/13613/) emits a seek error (past the end of file) during import. By analyzing the file itself, it seems the SSND chunk size goes beyond the end of the file (if anything, the parser has an `eof_reached` check, so it won't be a problem). Despite that, the file is perfectly usable with no noticeable artifacts.\r\n\r\nThe rest imported with no issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3945444738/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3993922050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-3993922050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":3993922050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uDmoC","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-03T22:18:54Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T22:28:33Z","body":"> In the mac world, `aiff` is very widespread\r\n\r\nA quick search led me find out a good portion of AIFF files exported by macOS apps are, internally, AIFC with the `sowt` compression type, which doesn't compress anything but signals data is little-endian.\r\n\r\nI didn't find any `sowt` files in freesound.org to test with, but I did find one file using `fl32` (data stored as 32-bit IEEE float). In any case, I decided to update the PR to handle AIFC \"compression\" types:\r\n\r\n- `sowt` sets the FileAccess to little-endian, then back to big-endian after data is read.\r\n- `fl32` and `fl64` will perform the float condition. Whether to use `get_float()` or `get_double()` is defined by `format_bits`.\r\n\r\nI have tested the `fl32` case, and it works just fine. The only thing missing to be in pair with WAV parsing would be metadata.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3993922050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4835023230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-4835023230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":4835023230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIDCZfg","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-29T16:56:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T16:56:37Z","body":"Rebased on top of the changes in #120036.\r\n\r\nVector COW is now avoided when getting AIFF data.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4835023230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5062487647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-5062487647","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":5062487647,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLb9uXw","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T19:27:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T19:27:40Z","body":"A rebase was needed after `audio_stream_wav.cpp/h` were moved to an `audio` subdirectory.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5062487647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858213688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184#issuecomment-5858213688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","id":5858213688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXS0_OA","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-27T17:42:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T17:45:53Z","body":"I decided to incorporate #115534 into this PR. The only \"problem\" that PR solved was blocking this one from implementing metadata tag support for AIFF.\r\n\r\nThat said, here is some metadata injected via Audacity:\r\n<img width=\"959\" height=\"196\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a38030e-1b96-447c-8e23-4d565f345b83\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5858213688/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]